{
  "uid": "detail-studio-game",
  "title": "詳細 · studio・game",
  "description": "開発の環境の studio・game を詳しく調べる（上の変数で切り替える）。行は 4 つのゴールデンシグナルの Errors・Latency・Traffic（Saturation は入口 · 正常の「Saturation」の行で、プロセスの名前 next-server（studio・game の開発のサーバー）で見る）。ページは SERVER のスパンのうち経路の付いた名前（RSC GET /cards 等）、core の呼び出しは /graphql への fetch（CLIENT のスパン）。表の行から Tempo のトレースへ移れる（core#109）",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": [
    "diecardomain",
    "detail",
    "studio",
    "game"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "ダッシュボード",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "diecardomain"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app",
        "label": "画面",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "studio,game",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "studio",
          "value": "studio"
        },
        "options": [],
        "description": "studio と game のどちらを見るか"
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "環境",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "development,test",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "development",
          "value": "development"
        },
        "options": [],
        "description": "開発の環境（development）とテスト用の環境（test。make test）のどちらを見るか（core#120）"
      }
    ]
  },
